pe, named after NASA's first Chief of Astronomy, will observe black holes, exoplanets and exploding stars.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's Christian Churches take a stand against far right</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3200271ab1cc778010ed046d8e2bea889d0a3ba27147f58a1a8c61f63ccb00d</id><updated>2026-08-30T19:21:56Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T15:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-christian-churches-take-a-stand-against-far-right/a-78482465--df145112005e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-christian-churches-take-a-stand-against-far-right/a-78482465?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The AfD in Saxony-Anhalt has embarked on a confrontational course toward the churches. Representatives of the Catholic and Protestant churches are responding with a mix of anxiety and resolve.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>EU wants drones to spray pesticides — but it could backfire</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1aecd5e35b46eaf88d4cce77600ccb3032c758d65d620d7ec3112d8d2e7cbd0c</id><updated>2026-08-30T19:21:56Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T15:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-wants-drones-to-spray-pesticides-but-it-could-backfire/a-78557154--0a305cd9a870.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-wants-drones-to-spray-pesticides-but-it-could-backfire/a-78557154?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU wants to lift a decades-old ban on spraying pesticides from the air, allowing drones to be used for greater precision. But experts warn the plan could lead to even more pesticides being used in agriculture.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Guinea-Bissau votes to reshape presidency</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:71b73bdd3875ce6215f0c2db45f30ac7d649f9498910a2466a080d9eb923178f</id><updated>2026-08-30T19:2