olitical tensions in the North Atlantic.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Greece, Turkey clash over protected Aegean marine areas</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:924f392d7c6411f09c6b905145557b6c6916e354d539cb14c0625527d4bd1fd4</id><updated>2026-08-30T19:21:56Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T09:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/greece-turkey-clash-over-protected-aegean-marine-areas/a-78550021--5945932eb9fb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/greece-turkey-clash-over-protected-aegean-marine-areas/a-78550021?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Turkey has announced the creation of two protected zones in a disputed area of the Aegean Sea, sparking an angry reaction from Greece. Does this mark a new chapter in a long-running dispute between the two countries?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India's citizen-led school audits test limits of activism</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:330885bd4f23adffe5c3b14e1fd79f695d559f65de2bfbaa498357aa1e27d0d5</id><updated>2026-08-30T19:21:56Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T09:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-s-citizen-led-school-audits-test-limits-of-activism/a-78545789--626068e76fe6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-citizen-led-school-audits-test-limits-of-activism/a-78545789?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The student-led "Cockroach" movement is taking its campaign for accountability to government schools, but the activists' methods are encountering growing resistance from authorities.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Manhunt underway after woman killed in Swiss rave shooting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d067170cdda4baa133772e8919754a4557e101a4d25a8a3dfa8257b4bd43bbe8</id><updated>2026-08-30T19:21:56Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T08:59:00Z</published><link rel="alterna