n emotional tribute to his late father, Harald V, in his first address to the nation. Vowing to follow his own path, Haakon pledged to uphold Norway’s democracy, unity and inclusive values.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Turkish, Somali forces free vessel seized by pirates in Somalia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e5a3b99fd4acb8bb9b969ffd92e89a10e55a196832237828e57813932ee85e98</id><updated>2026-08-30T19:21:56Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T20:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/turkish-somali-forces-free-vessel-seized-by-pirates-in-somalia/a-78560087--0908c6599c56.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/turkish-somali-forces-free-vessel-seized-by-pirates-in-somalia/a-78560087?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Turkish and Somali forces have freed the MV LUTUF after pirates hijacked the vessel off the coast of Somalia. The 10-day operation killed 14 alleged pirates and destroyed four boats used by the attackers.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Israeli settlers attack Palestinian homes in West Bank</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:17377eb60222a3bf6476e36d657872aa09612089ef020836752cb2bff2a62d49</id><updated>2026-08-30T19:21:56Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T19:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/israeli-settlers-attack-palestinian-homes-in-west-bank/a-78560116--06b00ccd6355.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israeli-settlers-attack-palestinian-homes-in-west-bank/a-78560116?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Masked Israeli settlers launched their first major attack since initiating a siege in the village of Qusra earlier this month. Saturday's attacks were met with rare criticism from Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Zimbabwe crash involving church minibus kills 27</title><id>urn:rssync:ent